Output assets/popup_placeholder.gif
Require tui-textarea-popup-placeholder
Set Height 240
Source recordings/common.tape
Env TUI_TEXTAREA_RECORDING_SIZE "120x12"

Hide
Type "tui-textarea-popup-placeholder"
Enter
Sleep 750ms
Show

Sleep 750ms
Type "Hello, styled world!"
Sleep 1s
Ctrl+J
Sleep 1s

Hide
Escape
Sleep 250ms
